          {
            "title": "Last item",
            "id": 96223,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Python ci permette di usare l'<strong>indicizzazione negativa</strong> per recuperare valori dalla fine di un oggetto indicizzabile, come una lista.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"4.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"latest = scores[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(latest)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>latest</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Explained",
            "id": 97110,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'indicizzazione negativa significa recuperare un elemento dal lato più a destra di una lista. Usiamo il simbolo <code>-</code> per indicare un indice negativo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"last = users[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Tom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'indicizzazione negativa recupera un elemento dall'estremità destra di un elenco.</p><p>Usiamo il simbolo <code>-</code> per indicare un indice negativo.</p><p>Memorizza l'<strong>ultimo</strong> utente in <code>last</code> usando un indice negativo, quindi stampa <code>last</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"last = users[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Tom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>1</code>, seguito da <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Item position",
            "id": 96224,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare qualsiasi valore negativo fino alla lunghezza dell'elenco inclusa, ottenendo così il primo valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ratings = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ratings[\" /><text value=\"-6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-</code>, seguito da <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare qualsiasi valore negativo fino alla lunghezza dell'elenco inclusa, recuperando così il primo valore.</p><p>L'elenco contiene <code>6</code> valutazioni. Usa un indice negativo che arrivi fino alla <strong>prima</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ratings = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ratings[\" /><text value=\"-6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-</code>, seguito da <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Modifying list items",
            "id": 96225,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche modificare gli elementi della lista nella posizione indicata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ahmed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jill', 'Ahmed', 'Elaine']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-</code>, seguito da <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando un indice negativo, sostituisci il <strong>primo</strong> utente con <code>\"Jill\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ahmed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jill', 'Ahmed', 'Elaine']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-</code>, seguito da <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Tuples",
            "id": 96226,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le tuple sono anch'esse strutture di dati ordinate e i valori possono essere recuperati, ma sono <strong>immutabili</strong> e quindi non possono essere modificate.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"info = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Graz&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Austria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Europe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;World&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"info[\" /><text value=\"-4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vienna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"TypeError: 'tuple' object does not support item assignment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Out of range error",
            "id": 96227,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si verificherà un errore se tentiamo di recuperare un valore in una posizione al di fuori dell'intervallo dell'oggetto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"results = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Win&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Loss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Draw&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"results[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-</code>, seguito da <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'elenco contiene solo <code>3</code> elementi. Usa un indice negativo oltre il suo inizio affinché generi <code>IndexError: list index out of range</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"results = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Win&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Loss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Draw&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"results[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-</code>, seguito da <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` keyword",
            "id": 96228,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La parola chiave <code>del</code> ci consente di eliminare oggetti o elementi all'interno di una struttura dati.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"winners = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sigmund&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Olaf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" winners[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(winners)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['John', 'Helen', 'Sigmund']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>del</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` objects",
            "id": 96230,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> può essere usato per eliminare qualsiasi oggetto, comprese strutture dati come dizionari, liste e insiemi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"letters = {\" /><text value=\"'a'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'b'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'c'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" letters\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(letters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'letters' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>letters</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La parola chiave <code>del</code> elimina una variabile, anche se contiene una lista, un dizionario o un set.</p><p>Dopo l'eliminazione, prova a stampare la variabile per generare <code>NameError</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"letters = {\" /><text value=\"'a'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'b'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'c'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" letters\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(letters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;letters&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'letters' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>letters</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` on dictionary",
            "id": 96231,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>del</code> con una chiave all'interno di un dizionario per rimuovere dal dizionario le coppie <code>key:value</code> indesiderate.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"product = {\" /><text value=\"'category'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'book'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'price'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" product[\" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(product)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"del\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'category': 'book', 'price': 4.99}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>product</code>, seguito da <code>[</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>del</code> con una chiave in un dizionario per rimuovere una coppia chiave:valore indesiderata.</p><p>Usa <code>del</code> per rimuovere la coppia chiave:valore <code>\"in_shop\"</code> da <code>product</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"product = {\" /><text value=\"'category'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'book'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'price'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" product[\" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(product)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'price'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"del\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'category': 'book', 'price': 4.99}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>product</code>, seguito da <code>[</code>, <code>'in_shop'</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: indexing",
            "id": 96238,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali valori di indice possiamo usare quando recuperiamo un elemento di una lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Valori positivi o negativi compresi nell'intervallo dell'elenco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python consente di usare solo valori positivi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Valori positivi o negativi compresi nell'intervallo dell'elenco.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli elementi di un elenco possono essere recuperati con indici positivi o negativi compresi nel suo intervallo.</p><p>Un elenco contiene quattro elementi. Quale strategia di indicizzazione recupera un elemento senza errori?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usare <code>2</code> dall'inizio o <code>-2</code> dalla fine</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usare solo valori positivi perché Python rifiuta gli indici negativi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Usare <code>4</code> perché fa riferimento al quarto elemento</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Usare qualsiasi valore negativo perché gli indici negativi non possono essere fuori intervallo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usare <code>2</code> dall'inizio o <code>-2</code> dalla fine.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: indexing",
            "id": 96239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Recupera il primo e l'ultimo valore dalla tupla per usarli nel messaggio.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = user[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = user[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Joe 27\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>user</code>, seguito da <code>0</code> e poi <code>user</code>, <code>-</code>, <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Estrai dalla tupla il <strong>primo</strong> e l'<strong>ultimo</strong> valore per usarli nel messaggio.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = user[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = user[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Joe 27\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>user</code>, seguito da <code>0</code>, <code>user</code>, <code>-</code> e infine <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: list items",
            "id": 96233,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale valore verrà stampato da questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"members = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hayley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gareth&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(members[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Sarah\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sarah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayley</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Sarah.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli indici negativi contano a ritroso dalla fine di un elenco, iniziando con <code>-1</code> per l'ultimo elemento.</p><p>Segui <code>-3</code> nel codice. Quale membro viene stampato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"members = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hayley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gareth&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(members[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Sarah\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sarah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayley</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Anna</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Gareth</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Sarah.</p></body></html>"
